 ],
 "lines": [
  {
   "stanza": 0,
   "line": 0,
   "start": 8.6,
   "end": 11.118,
   "text": "Splish goes the water and splash goes the tub,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 0,
   "line": 1,
   "start": 11.668,
   "end": 14.029,
   "text": "it's bubbles and duckies and rub-a-dub-dub."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 0,
   "line": 2,
   "start": 14.579,
   "end": 17.059,
   "text": "And what's peeking up from the bubbles? Oh my!"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 0,
   "line": 3,
   "start": 17.609,
   "end": 20.062,
   "text": "Ten little tozies say, \"Hi, Daddy, hi!\""
  },
  {
   "stanza": 1,
   "line": 0,
   "start": 22.412,
   "end": 24.849,
   "text": "Here are the tozies, on the bottom of your feet,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 1,
   "line": 1,
   "start": 25.399,
   "end": 28.409,
   "text": "the heel's on the other side. Kick, splash, how neat!"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 1,
   "line": 2,
   "start": 28.959,
   "end": 31.49,
   "text": "The duck says a quack, and the bubbles go pop,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 1,
   "line": 3,
   "start": 32.04,
   "end": 34.413,
   "text": "and ten little tozies say, \"Don't ever stop!\""
  },
  {
   "stanza": 2,
   "line": 0,
   "start": 40.163,
   "end": 42.939,
   "text": "Then out with a whoosh, in a towel warm and wide,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 2,
   "line": 1,
   "start": 43.489,
   "end": 46.01,
   "text": "I dry every tozy, from side to side."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 2,
   "line": 2,
   "start": 46.56,
   "end": 48.785,
   "text": "A rub on your head and a boop on your nose,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 2,
   "line": 3,
   "start": 49.335,
   "end": 52.151,
   "text": "and one extra kiss for those just-washed toes."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 3,
   "line": 0,
   "start": 57.901,
   "end": 60.879,
   "text": "Then into pyjamas, all stars and moons bright,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 3,
   "line": 1,
   "start": 61.429,
   "end": 64.14,
   "text": "the top goes on easy, the bottoms are tight."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 3,
   "line": 2,
   "start": 64.69,
   "end": 66.926,
   "text": "I wiggle one leg in, and what do you know?"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 3,
   "line": 3,
   "start": 67.476,
   "end": 70.245,
   "text": "Pop! Out at the bottom, five tozies say hello!"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 4,
   "line": 0,
   "start": 72.595,
   "end": 75.065,
   "text": "The other leg now, it goes tug, tug, and whee!"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 4,
   "line": 1,
   "start": 75.615,
   "end": 78.038,
   "text": "Five more little tozies come waving at me."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 4,
   "line": 2,
   "start": 78.588,
   "end": 80.678,
   "text": "\"Hey, little tozies, get up in those sheets!"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 4,
   "line": 3,
   "start": 81.228,
   "end": 84.457,
   "text": "Come sleep right next to me, with your little tozy feet!\""
  },
  {
   "stanza": 5,
   "line": 0,
   "start": 90.207,
   "end": 92.956,
   "text": "So climb up on Daddy, your head by my knees,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 5,
   "line": 1,
   "start": 93.506,
   "end": 96.775,
   "text": "your tozies by my cheeks, if you please, if you please."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 5,
   "line": 2,
   "start": 97.325,
   "end": 99.88,
   "text": "Here's one little tozy, and here's tozy two."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 5,
   "line": 3,
   "start": 100.43,
   "end": 103.001,
   "text": "Those three in the middle? I don't know them. Do you?"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 6,
   "line": 0,
   "start": 105.351,
   "end": 107.735,
   "text": "Then five on the other, so cuddly and small,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 6,
   "line": 1,
   "start": 108.285,
   "end": 110.446,
   "text": "ten little tozies, and I love them all."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 6,
   "line": 2,
   "start": 110.996,
   "end": 113.388,
   "text": "You giggle and squirm when I tickle your feet,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 6,
   "line": 3,
   "start": 113.938,
   "end": 116.467,
   "text": "you tell me they're stinky, I tell you they're sweet."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 7,
   "line": 0,
   "start": 118.817,
   "end": 121.719,
   "text": "\"Why do I need tozies, when Daddy has big feet?\""
  },
  {
   "stanza": 7,
   "line": 1,
   "start": 122.269,
   "end": 124.731,
   "text": "So Daddy can kiss them, and tickle, and eat!"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 7,
   "line": 2,
   "start": 125.281,
   "end": 128.056,
   "text": "They're the most important part when you walk around,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 7,
   "line": 3,
   "start": 128.606,
   "end": 131.656,
   "text": "they keep you nice and steady, so you don't fall down."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 8,
   "line": 0,
   "start": 134.006,
   "end": 136.856,
   "text": "They ran out to meet me when I came through the door,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 8,
   "line": 1,
   "start": 137.406,
   "end": 140.081,
   "text": "they danced in the kitchen and stomped on the floor."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 8,
   "line": 2,
   "start": 140.631,
   "end": 142.954,
   "text": "These tozies look yummy, a tozy treat!"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 8,
   "line": 3,
   "start": 143.504,
   "end": 146.107,
   "text": "I'll eat them all up! Nom, nom! Oh, so sweet!"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 9,
   "line": 0,
   "start": 151.856,
   "end": 154.281,
   "text": "Now into your bed, and the lamp's turning low,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 9,
   "line": 1,
   "start": 154.831,
   "end": 157.266,
   "text": "I'll sing you a tozy song, soft and slow."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 9,
   "line": 2,
   "start": 157.816,
   "end": 160.167,
   "text": "I sing to your nose and I sing to your hair,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 9,
   "line": 3,
   "start": 160.717,
   "end": 163.077,
   "text": "and I sing to the tozies still wiggling there."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 10,
   "line": 0,
   "start": 165.427,
   "end": 168.056,
   "text": "Sleep, little tozies, so cuddly and neat,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 10,
   "line": 1,
   "start": 169.006,
   "end": 172.101,
   "text": "the moon's watching over your little tozy feet."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 10,
   "line": 2,
   "start": 173.051,
   "end": 175.921,
   "text": "Snuggle down under, so they won't turn blue,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 10,
   "line": 3,
   "start": 176.871,
   "end": 179.623,
   "text": "all comfy and cosy, the whole night through."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 11,
   "line": 0,
   "start": 185.773,
   "end": 188.413,
   "text": "Your eyes getting heavy, your yawn big and slow,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 11,
   "line": 1,
   "start": 188.963,
   "end": 191.451,
   "text": "I tuck in the blanket from top down to toe."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 11,
   "line": 2,
   "start": 192.001,
   "end": 194.907,
   "text": "I'll keep them all warm and all safe while you sleep,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 11,
   "line": 3,
   "start": 195.457,
   "end": 197.804,
   "text": "ten sleepy tozies, not making a peep."
  },
  {
   "stanza": 12,
   "line": 0,
   "start": 200.154,
   "end": 203.158,
   "text": "From the top of your head to the tip of your nose,"
  },
  {
   "stanza": 12,
   "line": 1,
   "start": 204.558,
   "end": 207.44,
   "text": "oh my, little one, Daddy loves those toes."
  }
 ],
 "voice": "am_fenrir"
}